1
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:26,610
[A Splendid Match]

2
00:01:27,539 --> 00:01:29,760
[Episode 18]

3
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:33,870
[Baoxiang Temple]

4
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:47,570
[Baoxiang Temple]

5
00:01:54,789 --> 00:01:56,200
Why are you standing here?

6
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:57,130
Aren't you cold?

7
00:01:57,780 --> 00:02:01,170
[Hall of the Great Hero]

8
00:01:58,150 --> 00:01:59,070
Third Master.

9
00:02:02,070 --> 00:02:03,630
I want to stay here

10
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,760
to clear my head.

11
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,080
Why is that?

12
00:02:10,300 --> 00:02:12,360
I need to make myself firmly remember

13
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:14,310
that the person standing in front of me

14
00:02:14,310 --> 00:02:15,570
is no ordinary person,

15
00:02:16,190 --> 00:02:18,120
but a Grand Secretary of the Court.

16
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,630
I see.

17
00:02:21,870 --> 00:02:23,150
You're hinting at me,

18
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,140
telling me to clear my head

19
00:02:25,630 --> 00:02:26,310
and

20
00:02:27,430 --> 00:02:29,360
not put on airs with you from now on.

21
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:31,680
I wouldn't dare.

22
00:02:32,750 --> 00:02:34,350
I promise that in the future,

23
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,660
I'll arrive before you do.

24
00:02:35,660 --> 00:02:37,060
I won't keep you waiting.

25
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,190
I never said that.

26
00:02:41,230 --> 00:02:42,190
I understand.

27
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,840
Seeing him today,

28
00:02:47,870 --> 00:02:49,670
he seems different from before.

29
00:02:51,850 --> 00:02:56,430
[Hall of the Great Hero]

30
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,750
The people connected to Prince Ruichang

31
00:02:54,750 --> 00:02:56,880
are far more numerous than we thought.

32
00:02:57,030 --> 00:03:00,090
Many of them held positions
in the Ministry of Revenue.

33
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:02,480
They have all been replaced now.

34
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,310
As a result, the Ministry of Revenue

35
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:05,840
is severely understaffed.

36
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:09,280
Although your father's personal morals
are flawed,

37
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,000
he has

38
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:13,030
nothing to do with Prince Ruichang.

39
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:16,960
He also has no close ties
with other high-ranking officials.

40
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:17,840
So,

41
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,850
after thinking it over,

42
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,520
I still

43
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,190
plan to keep him.

44
00:03:25,470 --> 00:03:26,470
What do you think?

45
00:03:28,190 --> 00:03:29,630
This is a matter of state.

46
00:03:29,910 --> 00:03:31,240
You don't need to ask me.

47
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:32,710
But

48
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,440
he is your father, after all.

49
00:03:40,750 --> 00:03:41,280
Oh right,

50
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,660
there is something I've been wanting
to ask you.

51
00:03:45,150 --> 00:03:46,150
Why did you help

52
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:47,710
Ye Xian so much?

53
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:49,800
You mean

54
00:03:50,079 --> 00:03:51,810
delivering that letter to him?

55
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,120
Didn't

56
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:57,360
you give me the message on purpose

57
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,310
so I could warn him?

58
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:02,120
Even though I intentionally

59
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:03,760
asked you to deliver it,

60
00:04:04,430 --> 00:04:06,280
you still had to agree to do it.

61
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,000
You knew perfectly well

62
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,840
that this matter was very dangerous.

63
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,750
You were kidnapped

64
00:04:10,750 --> 00:04:12,210
and almost lost your life,

65
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:14,300
but you still helped him recklessly.

66
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:15,630
Why?

67
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:17,720
Because...

68
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:22,040
He also took many risks to save me.

69
00:04:22,270 --> 00:04:23,120
To me,

70
00:04:23,310 --> 00:04:24,600
he is a true friend.

71
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,070
Just a friend?

72
00:04:52,870 --> 00:04:53,670
What about me?

73
00:04:57,950 --> 00:04:58,830
If I ever encountered

74
00:04:58,830 --> 00:05:00,430
such a dangerous situation,

75
00:05:01,310 --> 00:05:02,510
would you help me too?

76
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,160
I would.

77
00:05:06,270 --> 00:05:07,680
So I am also your friend?

78
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,190
Yes.

79
00:05:15,430 --> 00:05:17,270
Ever since I was appointed to the cabinet,

80
00:05:17,270 --> 00:05:19,360
matchmakers have been visiting frequently.

81
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,680
Old Madam and my mentor

82
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:22,350
are also pushing me hard.

83
00:05:24,560 --> 00:05:25,560
You are so young

84
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:27,290
and already a Grand Secretary.

85
00:05:27,950 --> 00:05:28,560
In the capital,

86
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:30,390
any family with a daughter to marry

87
00:05:30,390 --> 00:05:32,790
would naturally want an alliance with you.

88
00:05:33,159 --> 00:05:33,760
Is that so?

89
00:05:39,310 --> 00:05:40,170
What about you?

90
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:43,870
Me?

91
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,720
I don't want

92
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:03,090
to be just your friend.

93
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:05,880
Don't move. Listen to me.

94
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:08,860
We've been through so much together.

95
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:09,980
Are you willing

96
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:11,600
to marry me?

97
00:06:12,870 --> 00:06:18,490
♪ In the bustling crowd,
every step foreshadows this meeting ♪

98
00:06:19,930 --> 00:06:22,300
♪ Smiling, you remark
that no beautiful scenery in the world ♪

99
00:06:23,730 --> 00:06:27,450
♪ Can match this destined encounter ♪

100
00:06:28,540 --> 00:06:33,780
♪ Time passes quietly,
and this meeting feels like fate ♪Tranquil time, like a kind of connection ♪

101
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:37,760
♪ A lifetime spent answering this riddle ♪

102
00:06:38,740 --> 00:06:43,310
♪ If a story's beginning
requires courage ♪

103
00:06:44,510 --> 00:06:47,330
♪ I'm willing to take the brush first ♪

104
00:06:48,540 --> 00:06:51,170
♪ With a true heart, paint a scene of us
together through days and nights ♪

105
00:06:52,350 --> 00:06:55,150
♪ I'll always stand here,
quietly guarding ♪

106
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:57,070
Are you kidding me?

107
00:06:56,220 --> 00:06:58,909
♪ That very moment
of our first encounter ♪

108
00:06:57,310 --> 00:06:58,390
I never thought

109
00:06:58,830 --> 00:06:59,950
you would say this to me.

110
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:02,230
♪ Whether it is fate or divine will ♪

111
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:01,430
If I had known

112
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:02,800
you were going to tell me this,

113
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:04,000
I wouldn't have come today.

114
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:06,110
♪ There is no need to analyze it anymore ♪

115
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:05,630
I never thought

116
00:07:05,630 --> 00:07:07,030
about us being together.

117
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:10,690
♪ When you look back, the wind rises ♪

118
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:09,680
If you never thought about it,

119
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:11,620
then start thinking about it from today.

120
00:07:11,620 --> 00:07:14,530
♪ Gently stirring heartbeats and breaths ♪

121
00:07:15,010 --> 00:07:18,100
♪ Only your palm remains warm as before ♪

122
00:07:17,510 --> 00:07:18,270
No need.

123
00:07:18,950 --> 00:07:21,680
♪ Warming my wandering, lonely soul ♪

124
00:07:19,130 --> 00:07:20,630
I have already made up my mind.

125
00:07:20,630 --> 00:07:22,560
I won't marry in this lifetime.

126
00:07:22,810 --> 00:07:26,050
♪ Everything exists because of you ♪

127
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:25,440
I'll go to Shanxi to do business
in the future.

128
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:26,510
By then, you should also find

129
00:07:26,510 --> 00:07:27,040
a woman

130
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:29,860
♪ Every step together brings joy ♪

131
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,870
who is a suitable match for your status.

132
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:30,400
I have matters to attend to.

133
00:07:30,580 --> 00:07:33,340
♪ Day by day, side by side ♪

134
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,930
I must go back first.

135
00:07:34,350 --> 00:07:36,830
♪ Whether it is fate or divine will ♪

136
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:40,650
♪ There is no need to analyze it anymore ♪

137
00:07:42,070 --> 00:07:45,450
♪ When you look back, the wind rises ♪

138
00:07:46,490 --> 00:07:49,240
♪ Gently stirring heartbeats and breaths ♪Blow away your heartbeat and breath

139
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:54,560
♪ Year after year, side by side ♪

140
00:07:58,630 --> 00:07:59,830
So...

141
00:08:00,360 --> 00:08:02,020
Third Master proposed to you?

142
00:08:03,500 --> 00:08:08,970
[Pavilion of Fragrant Incense]

143
00:08:04,270 --> 00:08:05,800
And you rejected him?

144
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,040
Are you foolish, My Lady?

145
00:08:09,310 --> 00:08:10,430
That's Third Master,

146
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,630
the Grand Secretary.

147
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:13,830
So what?

148
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,040
The more powerful a man is,

149
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:18,180
the more wives and concubines he has.

150
00:08:18,870 --> 00:08:20,480
The Chen family is a large
established household.

151
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,610
If I married into it,

152
00:08:21,750 --> 00:08:22,630
I wouldn't be able to control it

153
00:08:22,630 --> 00:08:23,480
or stop it.

154
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,510
Besides,

155
00:08:26,040 --> 00:08:27,630
because of what happened to my mother,

156
00:08:27,630 --> 00:08:28,310
I no longer

157
00:08:28,310 --> 00:08:29,840
hold any hope for marriage.

158
00:08:30,430 --> 00:08:32,000
Even if it's Third Master,

159
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:33,570
it's no exception.

160
00:08:36,150 --> 00:08:36,840
I...

161
00:08:37,600 --> 00:08:39,460
I thought you liked Third Master.

162
00:08:41,390 --> 00:08:42,720
Liking him doesn't mean

163
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,789
I have to marry him.

164
00:08:46,150 --> 00:08:47,010
Think about it.

165
00:08:47,630 --> 00:08:49,670
I have Grandmother's love now.

166
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,670
My father can't control me.

167
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,360
And I have money.

168
00:08:53,750 --> 00:08:54,720
I should just live

169
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,850
freely and happily.

170
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,700
Why must I get married,

171
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,900
be trapped in a courtyard,

172
00:09:00,510 --> 00:09:01,710
and look for trouble?

173
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:06,910
[Pavilion of Fragrant Incense]

174
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,310
But...

175
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:07,180
-But...
-No buts.

176
00:09:07,270 --> 00:09:08,510
No matter how much I like him,

177
00:09:08,510 --> 00:09:10,040
I like myself more, don't I?

178
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:13,390
Besides,

179
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:15,270
I have many things

180
00:09:15,270 --> 00:09:16,800
to handle with my business.

181
00:09:17,150 --> 00:09:19,000
The batch of tea leaves I shipped
from Jiangnan

182
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,400
should be arriving soon.

183
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:21,810
That's the first

184
00:09:21,810 --> 00:09:22,940
shipment to Shanxi.

185
00:09:23,290 --> 00:09:31,040
[Pavilion of Fragrant Incense]

186
00:09:23,750 --> 00:09:24,870
I actually thought

187
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,030
I should go with this batch

188
00:09:26,030 --> 00:09:27,430
and make a trip to Shanxi.

189
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,910
Hearing reports from the managers
is one thing,

190
00:09:31,910 --> 00:09:33,320
but I won't feel settled

191
00:09:33,550 --> 00:09:35,080
unless I go see for myself.

192
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:40,200
My Lady.

193
00:09:55,670 --> 00:09:56,510
What's this?

194
00:09:57,270 --> 00:09:59,510
When you just reached coming-of-age,

195
00:10:00,090 --> 00:10:00,890
Madam started

196
00:10:00,910 --> 00:10:02,840
embroidering this wedding dress.

197
00:10:02,870 --> 00:10:04,500
She was afraid you might see it

198
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:05,620
and get upset,

199
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:08,080
so she always embroidered it in secret.

200
00:10:08,080 --> 00:10:09,150
That morning,

201
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,080
when I saw Madam,

202
00:10:13,510 --> 00:10:15,790
this wedding dress and a letter

203
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,620
were placed right beside her.

204
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,120
Madam left the letter

205
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:21,650
telling me to put the wedding dress
away first

206
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,440
and give it to you

207
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:24,880
on your wedding day.

208
00:10:26,510 --> 00:10:28,750
But after hearing what you just said

209
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,200
to Qingpu,

210
00:10:31,030 --> 00:10:32,390
I took the liberty

211
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:33,630
of thinking

212
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,910
I should give it to you now.

213
00:11:00,750 --> 00:11:02,210
My dear daughter Jinzhao.

214
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,260
Now that I'm leaving,

215
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:06,790
you are the one I worry about the most.

216
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:12,150
I'm a useless person.

217
00:11:13,550 --> 00:11:15,910
I have made many mistakes in my life,

218
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,630
among which two are the worst.

219
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,000
One

220
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,840
is marrying your father.

221
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,270
The other

222
00:11:24,870 --> 00:11:26,810
is sending you to Tongzhou,

223
00:11:27,320 --> 00:11:29,320
separating us mother and daughter.

224
00:11:30,390 --> 00:11:31,850
I sewed this wedding dress

225
00:11:31,960 --> 00:11:34,190
for you with my own hands.

226
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,750
My craftsmanship is just passable,

227
00:11:35,750 --> 00:11:37,280
but it is finally finished.

228
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,910
But at this very moment,

229
00:11:40,510 --> 00:11:42,510
I don't even know if leaving it to you

230
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,510
is right or wrong.

231
00:11:47,550 --> 00:11:50,030
See what a muddled person I am?

232
00:11:50,240 --> 00:11:51,600
Muddled my whole life,

233
00:11:52,120 --> 00:11:53,150
now

234
00:11:53,150 --> 00:11:55,810
I don't even have the strength left
for regrets.

235
00:11:55,960 --> 00:11:57,630
Whether you marry or not,

236
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,440
just keep this wedding dress

237
00:11:59,840 --> 00:12:02,080
as a memento.

238
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,790
My dear daughter,

239
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,330
You are smarter than me.

240
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:07,960
I only have one wish for you.

241
00:12:08,320 --> 00:12:09,120
In all things,

242
00:12:09,270 --> 00:12:11,200
learn from your maternal grandmother.

243
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:13,440
Be independent wherever you are.

244
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,550
Whatever you are,

245
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:18,320
don't be like me.

246
00:12:53,390 --> 00:12:54,850
Second Daughter-in-Law.

247
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:57,550
We cover the deficit every year.

248
00:12:57,790 --> 00:13:00,080
Why does it keep getting bigger?

249
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:02,200
Mother.

250
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:05,760
The common fund had little surplus
to begin with.

251
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:08,270
Our social expenses this year

252
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,640
have increased.

253
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:14,810
It's my failure as the household manager.

254
00:13:16,510 --> 00:13:17,670
It is not your fault.

255
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:20,340
For this large family,

256
00:13:20,630 --> 00:13:21,440
there have always been

257
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,970
more expenses than income.

258
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,630
Is Lian's dowry list

259
00:13:27,630 --> 00:13:28,510
ready?

260
00:13:30,270 --> 00:13:32,870
I was just about to discuss with you
about this.

261
00:13:33,670 --> 00:13:36,330
Lavish weddings are popular
in the capital now.

262
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:38,600
The Yao family has four sons.

263
00:13:39,150 --> 00:13:40,550
Yao Wenxiu is the fourth.

264
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:43,540
Lian will have three older sisters-in-law.

265
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,770
Among sisters-in-law,

266
00:13:45,900 --> 00:13:47,560
comparisons are inevitable.

267
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:49,920
If Lian's dowry is small,

268
00:13:50,030 --> 00:13:52,000
I'm afraid she will be bullied.

269
00:13:53,510 --> 00:13:55,370
You don't need to drop hints to me.

270
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,480
Whoever else I might shortchange,

271
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,120
I would never

272
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,450
shortchange your Lian.

273
00:14:04,750 --> 00:14:05,870
It's just that this hole

274
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:07,270
is simply too big.

275
00:14:17,480 --> 00:14:18,870
I've always heard

276
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:21,360
that the fourth branch's family estates

277
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,150
have been

278
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:24,500
doing quite well these years.

279
00:14:24,510 --> 00:14:25,550
The fourth branch's business

280
00:14:25,550 --> 00:14:26,550
has always been managed with the help

281
00:14:26,550 --> 00:14:27,630
of the Ji family.

282
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:30,000
Since they are good at doing business,

283
00:14:30,000 --> 00:14:32,080
naturally it's doing quite well.

284
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:36,240
Mother,

285
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:39,200
what do you mean?

286
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,460
This is what I'm thinking.

287
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,260
The fourth son's wife is gone.

288
00:14:48,510 --> 00:14:49,720
It's inappropriate for a widower like him

289
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:50,870
to raise children

290
00:14:51,150 --> 00:14:52,120
all by himself.

291
00:14:53,790 --> 00:14:55,150
As his legitimate mother,

292
00:14:55,150 --> 00:14:56,200
I can't just stand by

293
00:14:56,200 --> 00:14:57,320
and do nothing.

294
00:14:57,630 --> 00:14:58,600
If word gets out,

295
00:14:58,750 --> 00:15:00,080
I'll be the one to blame.

296
00:15:02,270 --> 00:15:03,080
Why don't we

297
00:15:03,720 --> 00:15:05,480
have his family

298
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:06,790
move back here?

299
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:09,680
[Ji Mansion of Tongzhou]

300
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,270
So?

301
00:15:13,600 --> 00:15:14,670
Did you find out where

302
00:15:14,670 --> 00:15:16,000
Zhao is going this time?

303
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:17,480
When exactly is she planning

304
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,880
to return to the capital?

305
00:15:19,550 --> 00:15:21,630
She's stayed there for nearly three years.

306
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:22,750
It's unreasonable.

307
00:15:22,750 --> 00:15:24,320
She isn't planning to return
to the capital.

308
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,480
She says it's for business.

309
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:27,910
It seems she brought in
a shipload of goods

310
00:15:27,910 --> 00:15:29,000
from Jiangnan.

311
00:15:29,510 --> 00:15:30,960
She went to the depot early in the morning

312
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,960
and didn't come back until just now.

313
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:35,360
The Old Madam is also too much.

314
00:15:35,360 --> 00:15:36,360
She didn't even

315
00:15:36,360 --> 00:15:37,360
consult me, the lady in charge

316
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:38,090
of the house.

317
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,750
She just let her mourn here.

318
00:15:39,750 --> 00:15:40,270
Does she really think

319
00:15:40,270 --> 00:15:41,400
this is Zhao's home?

320
00:15:41,910 --> 00:15:42,670
Where is Yao?

321
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:43,750
He just came back

322
00:15:43,750 --> 00:15:45,510
from checking the shop in Xianghe.

323
00:15:45,510 --> 00:15:47,030
Hearing his cousin arrived,

324
00:15:47,030 --> 00:15:47,670
he immediately went

325
00:15:47,670 --> 00:15:48,670
to her courtyard.

326
00:15:49,150 --> 00:15:50,510
My silly son.

327
00:15:51,120 --> 00:15:52,080
You go there.

328
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:53,360
Just say...

329
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,200
Just say that I'm not feeling well.

330
00:15:55,200 --> 00:15:56,400
Tell Yao to come back.

331
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:57,120
Yes.

332
00:15:58,000 --> 00:15:58,670
Forget it.

333
00:15:58,870 --> 00:15:59,730
I'll go myself.

334
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:10,510
Then start thinking about it today.

335
00:16:12,720 --> 00:16:14,250
I will wait for your answer.

336
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,150
[General Register of Land and Property Deeds
for the Ji Clan's Commercial Firm

337
00:16:29,150 --> 00:16:29,590
in Pingyang Prefecture, Da Yan]

338
00:16:34,270 --> 00:16:35,000
What?

339
00:16:35,320 --> 00:16:36,720
You know everything now?

340
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,840
Explain yourself.

341
00:16:39,600 --> 00:16:40,670
Sneaking around,

342
00:16:40,670 --> 00:16:42,320
buying land in Shanxi

343
00:16:42,670 --> 00:16:43,870
and setting up shops.

344
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,480
What are you trying to do?

345
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:47,360
I wasn't sneaking around.

346
00:16:47,550 --> 00:16:49,360
If I really wanted to sneak around,

347
00:16:49,360 --> 00:16:51,240
would you have been able to find out?

348
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:52,670
You think you're right, don't you?

349
00:16:52,670 --> 00:16:53,240
Gu Jinzhao,

350
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:55,100
what exactly are you trying to do?

351
00:16:55,390 --> 00:16:57,050
I'm not trying to do anything.

352
00:16:58,510 --> 00:17:00,120
I just heard that in Shanxi,

353
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:02,390
they are relatively tolerant of women
in business.

354
00:17:02,390 --> 00:17:04,250
Maybe I'll go there in the future,

355
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:06,680
so I'm preparing in advance.

356
00:17:09,069 --> 00:17:10,720
What do you mean by

357
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:13,000
"relatively tolerant of women"?

358
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:14,440
How far in the future?

359
00:17:15,440 --> 00:17:17,440
Are you not planning to get married?

360
00:17:18,270 --> 00:17:19,680
I never thought about getting married.

361
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:20,410
Ridiculous!

362
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:23,020
What are you doing?

363
00:17:23,880 --> 00:17:25,609
-You scared me!
-You scared me!

364
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,750
I disagree!

365
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:31,880
Let alone Grandmother,

366
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:33,110
I'm the first to disagree.

367
00:17:33,110 --> 00:17:34,310
On what grounds do you disagree?

368
00:17:34,310 --> 00:17:35,040
Because I...

369
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:41,920
I know

370
00:17:42,590 --> 00:17:43,990
you're scared because of

371
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:46,240
what happened with Aunt.

372
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:47,840
But...

373
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:50,000
But it's just like doing business.

374
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,400
Many people lose everything.

375
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,720
But you can't just stop doing it.

376
00:17:57,290 --> 00:17:58,270
You don't understand.

377
00:17:58,270 --> 00:17:59,600
How do I not understand?

378
00:18:07,070 --> 00:18:08,350
If you're afraid,

379
00:18:09,240 --> 00:18:10,670
why not marry me instead?

380
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:12,350
-I...
-What nonsense are you talking about?

381
00:18:12,350 --> 00:18:13,900
I'm not talking nonsense.

382
00:18:14,030 --> 00:18:15,110
Didn't Grandmother

383
00:18:15,110 --> 00:18:15,790
originally hope

384
00:18:15,790 --> 00:18:17,250
that we would be together?

385
00:18:18,070 --> 00:18:19,110
Do you like me?

386
00:18:20,270 --> 00:18:20,880
I...

387
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:25,680
I... I'm...

388
00:18:26,270 --> 00:18:28,210
I'm just worried about you.

389
00:18:28,410 --> 00:18:30,510
I'm worried that you'll end up
never marrying.

390
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:31,640
If you marry me,

391
00:18:32,030 --> 00:18:33,200
I promise you will never be

392
00:18:33,200 --> 00:18:35,260
scared or worried again in your life.

393
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,080
Greetings, First Madam.

394
00:18:38,310 --> 00:18:38,830
Quickly get up.

395
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:39,560
First Madam!

396
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:43,750
Mother.

397
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:45,080
Greetings, First Aunt.

398
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:47,270
What are you doing

399
00:18:47,510 --> 00:18:49,570
with the door closed so late at night?

400
00:18:49,960 --> 00:18:51,200
We were talking

401
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:54,310
about investing in the draft bank
in Jiangnan.

402
00:18:54,310 --> 00:18:55,240
It's confidential,

403
00:18:55,240 --> 00:18:56,700
so we had to close the door.

404
00:18:57,510 --> 00:18:58,790
I see.

405
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,030
Your father

406
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,400
asked you to go over.

407
00:19:02,640 --> 00:19:04,700
He has something to talk to you about.

408
00:19:06,640 --> 00:19:07,160
Yes.

409
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,440
Zhao.

410
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:18,000
The three-year mourning period
is almost over.

411
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:20,130
When are you returning to the capital?

412
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,650
I haven't thought about it yet.

413
00:19:23,030 --> 00:19:23,680
Why?

414
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:25,640
First Aunt,

415
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,160
do you not want me to stay?

416
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,070
How could I dare?

417
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:33,550
Even though you're not one of Ji family,

418
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,960
you're Old Madam's favorite.

419
00:19:36,720 --> 00:19:38,920
I wouldn't dare not let you stay.

420
00:19:45,510 --> 00:19:46,160
My Lady,

421
00:19:46,720 --> 00:19:47,750
why was First Madam

422
00:19:47,750 --> 00:19:49,750
speaking with such a barbed tongue?

423
00:19:49,830 --> 00:19:50,490
Never mind.

424
00:19:51,270 --> 00:19:52,480
For Yao's sake,

425
00:19:52,590 --> 00:19:53,850
I won't argue with her.

426
00:19:54,470 --> 00:20:01,540
[Chen Mansion]

427
00:19:54,790 --> 00:19:56,160
I just sent word to the palace,

428
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:57,440
saying I'm not feeling well,

429
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,970
and asked for half a day off.

430
00:19:59,000 --> 00:19:59,760
Third Master,

431
00:19:59,760 --> 00:20:00,640
didn't you say you'd let Miss Gu

432
00:20:00,640 --> 00:20:01,270
mourn in peace,

433
00:20:01,270 --> 00:20:02,680
giving her enough time to consider?

434
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:03,240
Why are you

435
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:04,500
running after her now?

436
00:20:05,160 --> 00:20:06,070
A few days ago, she

437
00:20:06,070 --> 00:20:07,890
shipped several ships of goods
from Jiangnan,

438
00:20:07,890 --> 00:20:09,750
intending to sell them in Shanxi.

439
00:20:10,830 --> 00:20:11,590
She is a person

440
00:20:11,590 --> 00:20:13,790
who is extremely cautious in business.

441
00:20:14,110 --> 00:20:15,100
I'm worried

442
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:16,860
she likes to do things herself

443
00:20:17,550 --> 00:20:19,750
and might go to Shanxi with these goods.

444
00:20:20,680 --> 00:20:22,080
That would mean trouble.

445
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:24,200
I'll go.

446
00:20:29,070 --> 00:20:30,270
Okay, go back.

447
00:20:30,490 --> 00:20:33,880
[Chen Mansion]

448
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:34,990
[Chen Mansion]

449
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:39,160
[Ji's Depot]

450
00:20:42,070 --> 00:20:42,720
My Lady.

451
00:20:44,830 --> 00:20:45,490
Uncle Ping.

452
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:46,830
The horses have been fed.

453
00:20:46,830 --> 00:20:49,270
We can set off after resting
for a quarter of an hour.

454
00:20:49,270 --> 00:20:49,750
Okay.

455
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,380
Uncle Ping,

456
00:20:51,510 --> 00:20:53,030
a powerful outsider can't compete
with a local.

457
00:20:53,030 --> 00:20:54,090
When you get there,

458
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:56,400
go pay our respects
to the local bosses.

459
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:57,860
And don't rush to compete.

460
00:20:57,880 --> 00:20:58,920
Whatever price they sell at,

461
00:20:58,920 --> 00:21:00,240
we sell at the same price.

462
00:21:00,240 --> 00:21:02,790
We can even make it five percent
more expensive

463
00:21:02,790 --> 00:21:03,720
than others.

464
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:05,800
It saves us from making enemies.

465
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:09,400
When we have established a foothold,

466
00:21:09,400 --> 00:21:11,000
we can think of other things.

467
00:21:11,820 --> 00:21:12,820
Then I

468
00:21:12,850 --> 00:21:14,710
will go check on the other things.

469
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:19,830
Do it carefully.

470
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:23,240
Let's go, My Lady.

471
00:21:26,750 --> 00:21:27,310
My Lady,

472
00:21:27,880 --> 00:21:28,940
it's Third Master.

473
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:41,790
Why is he here?

474
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,480
Third Master.

475
00:21:51,270 --> 00:21:52,000
Gu Jinzhao.

476
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,160
This is the

477
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,890
final answer you're giving me?

478
00:21:57,160 --> 00:21:58,240
Do you really not

479
00:21:59,070 --> 00:22:00,350
want to reconsider it?

480
00:22:02,880 --> 00:22:03,350
I...

481
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:04,750
I really...

482
00:22:05,270 --> 00:22:07,030
I really shouldn't have indulged you
so much.

483
00:22:07,030 --> 00:22:08,270
You just decide to leave

484
00:22:08,270 --> 00:22:09,930
and head straight for Shanxi.

485
00:22:11,820 --> 00:22:13,480
Who said I was going to Shanxi?

486
00:22:13,560 --> 00:22:14,520
I just wanted

487
00:22:14,550 --> 00:22:15,750
to see Uncle Ping off.

488
00:22:18,590 --> 00:22:19,820
Let me.

489
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:26,610
You're not going to Shanxi?

490
00:22:26,750 --> 00:22:27,480
Be careful.

491
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:32,090
If that's the case,

492
00:22:32,270 --> 00:22:34,070
you go ahead with your business.

493
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:34,880
I...

494
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,440
I'll go drink some tea

495
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:39,890
and wait for you.

496
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:45,420
My Lady,

497
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:46,720
we can depart.

498
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:48,920
Please be careful.

499
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,070
Take care, My Lady.

500
00:22:54,750 --> 00:22:55,510
Let's go!

501
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:20,480
This man

502
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,500
seems to have changed.

503
00:23:32,950 --> 00:23:34,390
Are you on leave today?

504
00:23:35,510 --> 00:23:36,110
No.

505
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:43,960
Then it must be

506
00:23:44,510 --> 00:23:46,310
that things aren't busy at Court

507
00:23:46,550 --> 00:23:48,010
and there's nothing much.

508
00:23:55,950 --> 00:23:58,370
My grandmother went to Baoping.

509
00:23:58,400 --> 00:24:00,920
Yao also returned to the capital today.

510
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:04,900
My eldest uncle and aunt are here.

511
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,510
How about I ask them out

512
00:24:06,640 --> 00:24:08,370
to talk with you, Third Master?

513
00:24:08,880 --> 00:24:10,870
I haven't even finished a cup of tea,

514
00:24:10,870 --> 00:24:13,130
and you're already trying to kick me out?

515
00:24:13,140 --> 00:24:14,140
No, no.

516
00:24:16,640 --> 00:24:17,510
That's good.

517
00:24:17,750 --> 00:24:19,610
There's no need to see the others.

518
00:24:19,790 --> 00:24:20,510
Today,

519
00:24:20,830 --> 00:24:21,760
I came to see you.

520
00:24:36,790 --> 00:24:37,350
You...

521
00:24:38,260 --> 00:24:39,370
Don't move.

522
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:41,550
Let's talk properly.

523
00:24:44,790 --> 00:24:45,440
Okay.

524
00:24:47,670 --> 00:24:49,650
Have you seriously considered

525
00:24:50,590 --> 00:24:51,350
what I said to you

526
00:24:51,350 --> 00:24:52,480
at Baoxiang Temple?

527
00:24:53,790 --> 00:24:54,640
Which part?

528
00:24:56,230 --> 00:24:58,560
The part about including me in your plans.

529
00:25:00,110 --> 00:25:01,540
Didn't I tell you

530
00:25:01,880 --> 00:25:03,210
I'm not considering it?

531
00:25:05,030 --> 00:25:06,270
Gu Jinzhao.

532
00:25:08,510 --> 00:25:09,720
Look at you now.

533
00:25:09,790 --> 00:25:11,520
You expect me to talk properly?

534
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:13,200
Go back to the capital with me.

535
00:25:15,270 --> 00:25:17,070
Maybe if you stay under my nose,

536
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:19,260
you'll be able to think properly.

537
00:25:19,550 --> 00:25:19,960
You...

538
00:25:21,590 --> 00:25:22,000
Hey!

539
00:25:22,750 --> 00:25:24,640
You're throwing your weight around!

540
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:26,120
Once in a while is fine.

541
00:25:27,270 --> 00:25:28,510
Anyway, the Ji family

542
00:25:28,510 --> 00:25:30,160
hasn't settled accounts with me
for a long time.

543
00:25:30,160 --> 00:25:31,070
Who says so?

544
00:25:31,350 --> 00:25:32,750
They've been submitted properly.

545
00:25:32,750 --> 00:25:34,750
They were handled by subordinates.

546
00:25:34,830 --> 00:25:36,760
Who knows if there were omissions?

547
00:25:37,510 --> 00:25:38,070
I should

548
00:25:38,680 --> 00:25:40,080
personally go over them.

549
00:25:47,440 --> 00:25:47,880
My Lady.

550
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:48,550
Ms. Zhao.

551
00:25:49,480 --> 00:25:50,940
How is the investigation?

552
00:25:55,200 --> 00:25:56,590
Third Master is not an outsider.

553
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:57,790
You can speak freely.

554
00:25:59,110 --> 00:25:59,720
Yes.

555
00:26:00,270 --> 00:26:01,800
As you instructed, My Lady,

556
00:26:01,830 --> 00:26:02,510
I went through Madam's

557
00:26:02,510 --> 00:26:04,110
belongings she brought to the Gu family

558
00:26:04,110 --> 00:26:05,030
item by item.

559
00:26:05,110 --> 00:26:06,510
And in a box,

560
00:26:06,640 --> 00:26:07,510
I found this.

561
00:26:14,480 --> 00:26:15,350
An IOU.

562
00:26:16,570 --> 00:26:18,250
[IOU]

563
00:26:18,070 --> 00:26:19,590
20,000 taels of silver.

564
00:26:18,290 --> 00:26:20,070
[Issuer: Mrs. Gu-Feng]
[Witness: Gu Deyuan]

565
00:26:20,750 --> 00:26:21,830
Who is this

566
00:26:22,030 --> 00:26:22,960
Mrs. Gu-Feng?

567
00:26:23,310 --> 00:26:24,720
It's the Old Madam of the Gu family.

568
00:26:24,720 --> 00:26:26,110
Seeing this IOU

569
00:26:26,110 --> 00:26:27,570
reminded me of something.

570
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:29,610
When Madam first married Master,

571
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:31,610
she went to the Daxin ancestral home.

572
00:26:31,610 --> 00:26:33,750
One day, Old Madam Gu came forward

573
00:26:33,980 --> 00:26:37,040
and wanted to borrow 20,000 taels of silver
from Madam.

574
00:26:37,140 --> 00:26:38,160
Madam was too polite to refuse,

575
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:38,960
so she agreed.

576
00:26:39,510 --> 00:26:40,640
Who would have thought that

577
00:26:40,640 --> 00:26:41,790
it's been 20 years,

578
00:26:42,350 --> 00:26:44,150
and it still hasn't been repaid.

579
00:26:44,510 --> 00:26:45,790
If Mother didn't push,

580
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:48,700
others naturally wouldn't
rush to repay it.

581
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:52,000
Did my paternal grandmother say

582
00:26:52,790 --> 00:26:55,120
what she was going to do
with so much money?

583
00:26:55,510 --> 00:26:56,910
I really don't know that.

584
00:26:57,200 --> 00:26:58,870
Among the wealthy families in the capital,

585
00:26:58,870 --> 00:27:00,530
none of them don't lack money.

586
00:27:00,590 --> 00:27:02,160
Families like your fourth branch,

587
00:27:02,160 --> 00:27:03,220
who manage so well,

588
00:27:03,270 --> 00:27:04,480
are extremely rare.

589
00:27:04,750 --> 00:27:07,000
Oh, I almost forgot to tell you something.

590
00:27:07,000 --> 00:27:08,260
Yesterday your father

591
00:27:08,440 --> 00:27:09,840
took your younger sister

592
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:11,530
and moved back to Daxin.

593
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:14,070
Is he

594
00:27:14,270 --> 00:27:16,000
merging back into the ancestral home?

595
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:16,920
I suppose so.

596
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:18,070
Your father

597
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:19,870
is a widower raising a daughter,

598
00:27:20,350 --> 00:27:22,280
so it's proper for him to move back.

599
00:27:22,410 --> 00:27:23,940
As for your ancestral home,

600
00:27:25,350 --> 00:27:26,640
isn't your cousin

601
00:27:27,160 --> 00:27:28,640
getting engaged to the son of

602
00:27:28,640 --> 00:27:29,510
Yao Ping, Vice Minister of Justice?

603
00:27:29,510 --> 00:27:30,590
Nowadays in the capital,

604
00:27:30,590 --> 00:27:32,030
lavish weddings are popular.

605
00:27:32,030 --> 00:27:32,960
It's even more difficult for a woman

606
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:33,920
marrying into a higher status.

607
00:27:33,920 --> 00:27:35,680
They're probably strapped for cash

608
00:27:35,680 --> 00:27:36,880
regarding the dowry.

609
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:39,480
So they've set their eyes

610
00:27:39,480 --> 00:27:41,140
on our fourth branch's money.

611
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:43,450
What a brilliant calculation.

612
00:27:45,110 --> 00:27:46,240
Unfortunately for them,

613
00:27:46,240 --> 00:27:47,840
they're dealing with me now.

614
00:27:47,960 --> 00:27:49,720
They want to move back
to the ancestral home, right?

615
00:27:49,720 --> 00:27:51,650
Then we'll all move back together.

616
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:03,300
This time, I'm not the one
throwing my weight around.

617
00:28:06,770 --> 00:28:10,150
[Balanced as stars on a tripod]

618
00:28:08,640 --> 00:28:10,400
I heard Third Master came over.

619
00:28:10,960 --> 00:28:12,550
I rushed back immediately,

620
00:28:12,830 --> 00:28:14,950
but still didn't make it in time.

621
00:28:16,410 --> 00:28:17,740
He came here on business

622
00:28:17,790 --> 00:28:18,920
and went back today.

623
00:28:19,110 --> 00:28:21,070
He said he has to be on duty tonight.

624
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,240
Somebody!

625
00:28:26,590 --> 00:28:28,220
Take this plate of
Three-Shred Steamed Dumplings

626
00:28:28,220 --> 00:28:29,290
to the clan school

627
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:30,640
for Rong.

628
00:28:30,790 --> 00:28:32,070
He studies hard.

629
00:28:32,270 --> 00:28:33,510
He gets hungry easily at night.

630
00:28:33,510 --> 00:28:34,070
Yes.

631
00:28:38,070 --> 00:28:39,270
First Madam is here.

632
00:28:42,070 --> 00:28:43,160
Mother.

633
00:28:46,350 --> 00:28:47,700
Second Madam Xu has left?

634
00:28:47,700 --> 00:28:49,560
Yes, she has left.

635
00:28:51,310 --> 00:28:52,240
Eat more.

636
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:55,240
You are busy with business every day,

637
00:28:55,240 --> 00:28:56,440
and have lost weight.

638
00:28:56,640 --> 00:28:57,720
I haven't lost weight.

639
00:28:57,720 --> 00:28:58,920
I'm just getting taller.

640
00:28:58,920 --> 00:29:00,070
Really?

641
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:02,060
You're growing taller again?

642
00:29:03,230 --> 00:29:05,480
I'll tell the kitchen later

643
00:29:05,480 --> 00:29:06,640
to make some soup for you

644
00:29:06,640 --> 00:29:07,970
to build up your health.

645
00:29:15,330 --> 00:29:16,810
Look how happy you are.

646
00:29:17,310 --> 00:29:18,920
Did something good happen?

647
00:29:20,310 --> 00:29:21,960
You noticed it, didn't you?

648
00:29:22,720 --> 00:29:23,690
Do you know

649
00:29:23,750 --> 00:29:25,160
why Second Madam Xu came to see me

650
00:29:25,160 --> 00:29:26,310
today?

651
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:28,350
Why?

652
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:30,830
She came to be a matchmaker for Yao.

653
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:32,240
Really?

654
00:29:33,440 --> 00:29:34,830
Which family?

655
00:29:35,200 --> 00:29:37,790
The eldest daughter of the Li family
at the East Gate.

656
00:29:37,790 --> 00:29:39,290
That family.

657
00:29:39,680 --> 00:29:41,200
They're average.

658
00:29:43,510 --> 00:29:45,110
I think so too.

659
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:47,400
But Second Madam Xu said

660
00:29:48,000 --> 00:29:49,350
that although the Li family's business

661
00:29:49,350 --> 00:29:51,070
is not as good as ours,

662
00:29:51,400 --> 00:29:53,420
they have a thriving

663
00:29:53,830 --> 00:29:55,310
and harmonious family.

664
00:29:56,350 --> 00:29:58,210
The biological mother of Miss Li,

665
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:59,390
the Third Madam,

666
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:01,580
is truly a woman of great fortune.

667
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,770
Besides having Miss Li,

668
00:30:03,860 --> 00:30:05,520
she even had twins

669
00:30:05,920 --> 00:30:07,520
at thirty-seven.

670
00:30:09,440 --> 00:30:11,440
Now, nearing forty,

671
00:30:12,110 --> 00:30:15,030
both her parents are still alive.

672
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:16,550
Tell me,

673
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:19,120
isn't she extremely blessed?

674
00:30:19,240 --> 00:30:20,400
I was thinking,

675
00:30:20,640 --> 00:30:23,500
Yao doesn't have any siblings.

676
00:30:24,830 --> 00:30:26,720
Did you say that for my benefit?

677
00:30:26,790 --> 00:30:28,700
Mother, you misunderstood.

678
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:30,680
That's not what I meant.

679
00:30:30,830 --> 00:30:31,680
I...

680
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:34,170
I only have Yao as my son.

681
00:30:34,510 --> 00:30:35,510
Naturally, I hope

682
00:30:35,550 --> 00:30:36,640
he can marry a

683
00:30:37,070 --> 00:30:38,920
blessed girl.

684
00:30:41,640 --> 00:30:42,510
Aunt.

685
00:30:43,400 --> 00:30:44,830
What do you mean by that?

686
00:30:45,480 --> 00:30:46,440
I know.

687
00:30:47,240 --> 00:30:48,570
Aren't you just worried

688
00:30:48,750 --> 00:30:49,440
that Grandmother

689
00:30:49,440 --> 00:30:50,750
will betroth me to Yao?

690
00:30:53,000 --> 00:30:54,860
I didn't want to marry him either.

691
00:30:55,310 --> 00:30:56,110
But if you keep

692
00:30:56,130 --> 00:30:57,590
bringing up my late mother

693
00:30:57,590 --> 00:30:58,400
to target me,

694
00:30:59,270 --> 00:31:00,550
then I might just change my mind.

695
00:31:00,550 --> 00:31:01,030
You...

696
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:02,440
My fate is poor to begin with.

697
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:04,110
It would be perfect to borrow

698
00:31:04,510 --> 00:31:05,750
some blessings from Yao.

699
00:31:05,750 --> 00:31:06,240
You!

700
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,030
Mother.

701
00:31:09,060 --> 00:31:09,590
Get out.

702
00:31:10,750 --> 00:31:11,510
Get out!

703
00:31:23,130 --> 00:31:30,110
[Glowing Bloom]

704
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:24,640
Grandmother.

705
00:31:25,750 --> 00:31:26,790
I plan

706
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:29,940
to go back to the capital in a few days.

707
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:33,610
Are you going back to the Gu family?

708
00:31:34,740 --> 00:31:36,540
Don't mind

709
00:31:36,570 --> 00:31:38,520
what your aunt said.

710
00:31:39,110 --> 00:31:40,110
In this house,

711
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:42,380
she is not the one in charge.

712
00:31:42,640 --> 00:31:44,030
Not back to Sili Hutong,

713
00:31:44,550 --> 00:31:45,440
but to

714
00:31:45,750 --> 00:31:47,210
the Daxin ancestral home.

715
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,510
What's going on?

716
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:52,440
I heard my father

717
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:55,500
is moving the fourth branch
back to the ancestral home.

718
00:31:55,830 --> 00:31:56,720
Although

719
00:31:56,750 --> 00:31:58,240
I haven't figured out

720
00:31:58,550 --> 00:31:59,950
what the exact reason is,

721
00:32:00,720 --> 00:32:01,640
I assume

722
00:32:01,790 --> 00:32:03,790
it won't be a harmonious situation.

723
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:04,830
You girl.

724
00:32:05,400 --> 00:32:06,730
You have a sharp tongue.

725
00:32:07,160 --> 00:32:08,290
Please listen to me.

726
00:32:08,440 --> 00:32:09,160
Ms. Zhao

727
00:32:09,160 --> 00:32:10,510
went through my mother's belongings

728
00:32:10,510 --> 00:32:11,750
and found an IOU.

729
00:32:12,030 --> 00:32:12,880
An IOU?

730
00:32:13,830 --> 00:32:15,090
It's from 20 years ago,

731
00:32:15,270 --> 00:32:16,880
for a full 20,000 taels of silver.

732
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:18,110
It was actually my paternal grandmother

733
00:32:18,110 --> 00:32:20,370
who borrowed it directly from my mother.

734
00:32:21,400 --> 00:32:22,160
Take a look.

735
00:32:22,770 --> 00:32:27,780
[IOU]

736
00:32:28,440 --> 00:32:29,960
When your mother was alive,

737
00:32:29,960 --> 00:32:31,110
she never mentioned

738
00:32:31,110 --> 00:32:32,640
this to me.

739
00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:37,400
Do you want to go back

740
00:32:38,070 --> 00:32:39,920
and get this money back?

741
00:32:40,440 --> 00:32:41,440
Of course I do.

742
00:32:41,750 --> 00:32:43,080
20,000 taels of silver,

743
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:44,880
with twenty years of compound interest,

744
00:32:44,880 --> 00:32:46,140
how much would that be?

745
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:51,030
You should get it back.

746
00:32:52,550 --> 00:32:53,960
Not just the debt.

747
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:56,790
When your mother married into the family,

748
00:32:56,790 --> 00:32:58,110
they hadn't split the household yet.

749
00:32:58,110 --> 00:33:00,510
The dowry all went to Daxin.

750
00:33:01,590 --> 00:33:04,070
Later, when we divided the property
and checked the inventory,

751
00:33:04,070 --> 00:33:05,680
many things were missing.

752
00:33:07,030 --> 00:33:08,030
There was a set

753
00:33:08,350 --> 00:33:10,010
of yellow rosewood furniture

754
00:33:10,790 --> 00:33:12,650
that they actually replaced with

755
00:33:12,680 --> 00:33:13,750
boxwood ones.

756
00:33:15,400 --> 00:33:17,030
Your poor mother was useless.

757
00:33:17,030 --> 00:33:19,560
She just swallowed her anger
and accepted it.

758
00:33:21,200 --> 00:33:23,160
Since you are going to Daxin this time,

759
00:33:23,160 --> 00:33:24,440
you might as well

760
00:33:24,510 --> 00:33:25,750
ask for it all back.

761
00:33:29,110 --> 00:33:30,580
So,

762
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:32,350
you agree to let me go back?

763
00:33:35,830 --> 00:33:37,950
You are a child with your own ideas.

764
00:33:38,750 --> 00:33:40,000
You know what should be done

765
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:41,310
and what shouldn't.

766
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:44,270
You've always had good judgment.

767
00:33:45,880 --> 00:33:48,310
Although I hate to see you go,

768
00:33:49,070 --> 00:33:50,350
I also know that

769
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:52,720
a child kept tied to the apron strings

770
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:54,450
will never achieve greatness.

771
00:33:54,960 --> 00:33:55,890
If you want to go,

772
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:57,400
then go.

773
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:01,030
But you must remember one thing.

774
00:34:01,480 --> 00:34:02,960
My home

775
00:34:03,070 --> 00:34:04,470
is your home.

776
00:34:04,550 --> 00:34:05,510
Whenever

777
00:34:05,510 --> 00:34:07,570
you want to come back, just come back.

778
00:34:07,720 --> 00:34:08,550
Got it?

779
00:34:10,840 --> 00:34:11,710
Got it.

780
00:34:13,960 --> 00:34:15,260
Grandmother,

781
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:17,530
you are the one I hate to leave the most.

782
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:21,590
I hate to part with you too.

783
00:34:24,760 --> 00:34:25,400
Thank you.

784
00:34:31,670 --> 00:34:32,469
Young Master.

785
00:34:32,550 --> 00:34:33,630
The old gatekeeper said

786
00:34:33,630 --> 00:34:35,110
the Gu family's fourth branch has returned
to their ancestral home.

787
00:34:35,110 --> 00:34:35,710
A few days ago,

788
00:34:35,710 --> 00:34:37,510
the whole branch moved to Daxin.

789
00:34:37,880 --> 00:34:39,139
What about Gu Jinzhao?

790
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:42,280
He said she arrived in the capital
yesterday.

791
00:34:42,590 --> 00:34:43,590
She came back here first,

792
00:34:43,590 --> 00:34:44,590
packed some things,

793
00:34:44,590 --> 00:34:46,719
and left for Daxin early this morning.

794
00:34:48,000 --> 00:34:49,239
How heartless of her.

795
00:34:49,320 --> 00:34:50,070
She moved without even

796
00:34:50,070 --> 00:34:50,880
telling me.

797
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:56,900
Greetings, Grandmother.

798
00:35:00,480 --> 00:35:01,140
Have a seat.

799
00:35:03,000 --> 00:35:04,400
Thank you, Grandmother.

800
00:35:06,760 --> 00:35:07,920
Why didn't you bring Rong

801
00:35:07,920 --> 00:35:08,920
back with you?

802
00:35:10,070 --> 00:35:12,820
The Ji family are outsiders after all,

803
00:35:13,030 --> 00:35:14,360
and they are merchants.

804
00:35:14,870 --> 00:35:15,540
Rong

805
00:35:15,630 --> 00:35:17,440
is the only heir of your fourth branch.

806
00:35:17,440 --> 00:35:19,880
He'll have to take the imperial
examination sooner or later.

807
00:35:19,880 --> 00:35:21,190
He can't hang around with a bunch of

808
00:35:21,190 --> 00:35:22,920
merchants all day long.

809
00:35:23,190 --> 00:35:24,510
He still needs to come back.

810
00:35:24,510 --> 00:35:26,630
Focusing on his studies
is the right thing to do.

811
00:35:26,630 --> 00:35:29,150
I think so too.

812
00:35:31,760 --> 00:35:32,560
Grandmother.

813
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:35,130
Although the Ji family are merchants,

814
00:35:35,280 --> 00:35:36,460
their family school

815
00:35:36,490 --> 00:35:38,210
is famous even in the capital.

816
00:35:39,070 --> 00:35:40,280
Even Mr. Chen Xuanqing

817
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:42,340
once studied at the Ji family.

818
00:35:42,800 --> 00:35:44,400
Why can't Rong go there?

819
00:35:45,880 --> 00:35:46,620
Besides,

820
00:35:46,710 --> 00:35:47,400
Rong

821
00:35:47,400 --> 00:35:48,710
did return to the capital.

822
00:35:48,710 --> 00:35:49,690
He just went straight

823
00:35:49,690 --> 00:35:51,350
to the Qifang Hutong Academy.

824
00:35:52,570 --> 00:35:54,400
So Rong is back?

825
00:35:54,840 --> 00:35:55,960
Then why didn't he think of

826
00:35:55,960 --> 00:35:57,160
coming to see us first?

827
00:35:57,160 --> 00:35:58,290
Whose idea was this?

828
00:35:58,960 --> 00:36:00,110
Grandmother,

829
00:36:00,230 --> 00:36:01,440
it was my idea.

830
00:36:01,670 --> 00:36:02,630
Your idea?

831
00:36:05,840 --> 00:36:07,770
Without a mistress in the family,

832
00:36:07,840 --> 00:36:09,620
you really lack manners.

833
00:36:10,670 --> 00:36:11,280
Dezhao.

834
00:36:12,360 --> 00:36:13,440
Lan and Zhao

835
00:36:13,440 --> 00:36:14,500
have both grown up.

836
00:36:14,510 --> 00:36:15,070
Later, I will

837
00:36:15,070 --> 00:36:16,930
call the nannies from my room over

838
00:36:17,150 --> 00:36:18,490
to properly teach them

839
00:36:18,590 --> 00:36:19,760
manners and rules.

840
00:36:21,230 --> 00:36:23,400
So they won't embarrass themselves
when it's time

841
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:24,660
to arrange marriages.

842
00:36:24,670 --> 00:36:25,470
Grandmother.

843
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,800
Lan and I just finished
our mourning period.

844
00:36:27,800 --> 00:36:29,660
Why the rush to discuss marriage?

845
00:36:30,320 --> 00:36:31,440
Is this the lesson of manners and rules

846
00:36:31,440 --> 00:36:33,000
of our ancestral home?

847
00:36:34,070 --> 00:36:36,000
Then perhaps we'd better not learn.

848
00:36:36,000 --> 00:36:36,760
Zhao.

849
00:36:41,440 --> 00:36:42,320
Mother.

850
00:36:42,960 --> 00:36:45,510
Zhao just returned home.

851
00:36:45,710 --> 00:36:47,480
If she's ignorant about anything,

852
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:49,670
we can discipline her later.

853
00:36:51,840 --> 00:36:52,670
Zhao.

854
00:36:53,150 --> 00:36:54,630
I heard your father say

855
00:36:54,880 --> 00:36:56,480
that you are now managing the accounts

856
00:36:56,480 --> 00:36:58,480
of the fourth branch's common fund.

857
00:36:59,230 --> 00:36:59,960
Ms. Zhao.

858
00:37:08,000 --> 00:37:10,130
All the common fund accounts are here.

859
00:37:10,510 --> 00:37:11,960
However, because my mother

860
00:37:10,700 --> 00:37:12,310
[General Account of Household Expenses
for Gu Mansion, Director of the Treasury]

861
00:37:11,960 --> 00:37:13,000
has been bedridden for years,

862
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:14,200
they were neglected.

863
00:37:14,920 --> 00:37:15,880
And my father

864
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:17,760
has been fully focused on his career.

865
00:37:17,760 --> 00:37:19,290
So there isn't much profit.

866
00:37:19,320 --> 00:37:21,250
I hope you won't mind, Second Aunt.

867
00:37:21,590 --> 00:37:23,230
Not at all.

868
00:37:28,630 --> 00:37:29,990
Old Madam, Madam.

869
00:37:30,070 --> 00:37:31,400
Young Master Ye is here.

870
00:37:31,630 --> 00:37:32,830
What is he doing here?

871
00:37:34,630 --> 00:37:35,820
Did he state his purpose?

872
00:37:35,820 --> 00:37:36,710
No, he didn't.

873
00:37:37,630 --> 00:37:38,440
You may leave.

874
00:37:38,590 --> 00:37:39,110
Yes.

875
00:37:42,550 --> 00:37:44,080
Why is he here?

876
00:37:44,920 --> 00:37:46,070
Could it be that our family

877
00:37:46,070 --> 00:37:48,000
is in some kind of trouble, Mother?

878
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:49,200
Don't talk nonsense.

879
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:50,960
If anything happened,

880
00:37:50,960 --> 00:37:52,920
your Fifth Aunt would let us know.

881
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:55,120
What's wrong?

882
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:58,020
Young Master Ye doesn't come here often?

883
00:37:58,710 --> 00:37:59,550
Zhao,

884
00:37:59,880 --> 00:38:01,070
you have no idea.

885
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:02,840
Young Master Ye

886
00:38:02,860 --> 00:38:04,780
has now joined the Penal Court.

887
00:38:05,150 --> 00:38:06,280
He's spending his days

888
00:38:06,280 --> 00:38:08,510
confiscating property
and executing people.

889
00:38:08,510 --> 00:38:10,070
We are all afraid to see him.

890
00:38:10,510 --> 00:38:11,710
Even your Second Uncle

891
00:38:11,710 --> 00:38:13,150
shudders when he sees him.

892
00:38:13,150 --> 00:38:13,840
Your Grandmother has already

893
00:38:13,840 --> 00:38:15,280
instructed your Fifth Aunt

894
00:38:15,280 --> 00:38:17,480
to ask him not to come around for a while.

895
00:38:18,550 --> 00:38:19,320
Mother,

896
00:38:19,670 --> 00:38:21,190
he is an heir after all.

897
00:38:21,710 --> 00:38:22,510
How about

898
00:38:23,030 --> 00:38:24,710
we go out and greet him?

899
00:38:26,880 --> 00:38:27,670
Greet him?

900
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:29,920
He's a junior.

901
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:32,030
Does he expect me to bow to him?

902
00:38:33,360 --> 00:38:33,880
Ms. Su.

903
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:34,550
Yes.

904
00:38:35,110 --> 00:38:35,710
You go

905
00:38:36,110 --> 00:38:37,840
tell him to go to his sister's room.

906
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:38,920
No need to come here.

907
00:38:38,920 --> 00:38:39,850
No need for what?

908
00:38:45,190 --> 00:38:47,230
Greetings, Your Highness.

909
00:38:48,240 --> 00:38:49,640
Old Madam, please get up.

910
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:51,230
I am just a junior.

911
00:38:51,710 --> 00:38:53,510
I wouldn't dare accept your bow.

912
00:38:54,510 --> 00:38:56,340
Your Highness, you're joking.

913
00:38:56,510 --> 00:38:57,360
Bowing to you

914
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:59,150
is what I should do.

915
00:39:12,150 --> 00:39:13,150
I'm here for you.

916
00:39:13,590 --> 00:39:14,230
Come out.

917
00:39:14,800 --> 00:39:16,460
I have something to say to you.

918
00:39:35,230 --> 00:39:35,840
Ye Xian.

919
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:45,920
Well...

920
00:39:46,510 --> 00:39:48,370
Do you also think I'm terrifying?

921
00:39:49,000 --> 00:39:49,760
Since when did your hearing

922
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:50,840
get so good?

923
00:39:51,230 --> 00:39:52,510
We were talking behind your back,

924
00:39:52,510 --> 00:39:53,640
and you heard it all?

925
00:39:54,880 --> 00:39:56,630
The Penal Court collects intelligence

926
00:39:56,630 --> 00:39:58,030
and monitors officials.

927
00:39:58,070 --> 00:39:59,710
Eavesdropping on people

928
00:40:00,070 --> 00:40:01,600
is exactly our line of work.

929
00:40:02,760 --> 00:40:03,710
Really?

930
00:40:05,630 --> 00:40:06,320
No.

931
00:40:06,760 --> 00:40:07,360
I held a blade

932
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:08,820
against that girl's neck.

933
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:11,190
Naturally, she didn't dare make a sound,

934
00:40:11,190 --> 00:40:12,440
letting me stand outside the door

935
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:13,360
and listen

936
00:40:13,630 --> 00:40:14,690
as much as I wanted.

937
00:40:15,670 --> 00:40:17,130
Why did you have to do that?

938
00:40:20,030 --> 00:40:21,490
Can you say something new?

939
00:40:21,710 --> 00:40:22,600
"Why do that?"

940
00:40:22,620 --> 00:40:23,400
"Why bother?"

941
00:40:23,400 --> 00:40:24,320
"Why is that?"

942
00:40:25,110 --> 00:40:27,110
Ever since I joined the Penal Court,

943
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:29,840
I've gotten sick of hearing these phrases.

944
00:40:31,550 --> 00:40:32,360
Okay.

945
00:40:32,550 --> 00:40:33,750
I won't say anything.

946
00:40:36,510 --> 00:40:37,240
What is this?

947
00:40:40,760 --> 00:40:42,280
I just caught two wanted criminals

948
00:40:42,280 --> 00:40:43,610
and got some blood on me.

949
00:40:45,110 --> 00:40:45,670
Well...

950
00:40:46,920 --> 00:40:48,050
Does it disgust you?

951
00:40:48,920 --> 00:40:49,480
Alright.

952
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:50,840
Go to the guest courtyard

953
00:40:50,840 --> 00:40:52,370
and change out of your robe.

954
00:40:53,440 --> 00:40:54,900
Ye Xian, stop right there.

955
00:40:57,030 --> 00:40:59,490
Do you believe
I'll never speak to you again?

956
00:41:11,510 --> 00:41:12,190
Alright.

957
00:41:13,400 --> 00:41:14,000
I know you...

958
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:15,000
You know nothing!

959
00:41:18,190 --> 00:41:19,990
Why do you have to take this path?

960
00:41:23,590 --> 00:41:24,920
Because I need power,

961
00:41:26,070 --> 00:41:26,920
and people.

962
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:30,110
Then can't you...?

963
00:41:30,110 --> 00:41:30,770
No, I can't.

964
00:41:31,550 --> 00:41:32,810
I've thought about it.

965
00:41:33,320 --> 00:41:34,580
There is no other path.

966
00:41:35,440 --> 00:41:36,630
It's the only way

967
00:41:36,630 --> 00:41:37,840
to save my family.

968
00:41:49,150 --> 00:41:50,030
What's this?

969
00:41:50,670 --> 00:41:51,590
It's a bracelet

970
00:41:53,150 --> 00:41:54,800
confiscated from a seized property.

971
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:56,320
It's already been accounted for.

972
00:41:56,320 --> 00:41:57,980
You can wear it without worry.

973
00:42:00,710 --> 00:42:02,360
-This...
-Throw it away

974
00:42:02,760 --> 00:42:04,220
if you think it's tainted.

975
00:42:31,190 --> 00:42:35,710
[Eternal Glory]

976
00:43:10,730 --> 00:43:11,550
I'm sorry, Lian.

977
00:43:11,550 --> 00:43:12,630
It hurts so much.

978
00:43:14,190 --> 00:43:16,050
I'm... I'm sorry.

979
00:43:18,920 --> 00:43:20,120
Let me prick you once,

980
00:43:20,230 --> 00:43:21,430
and I'll forgive you.

981
00:43:22,550 --> 00:43:23,480
Lian,

982
00:43:23,960 --> 00:43:25,150
I didn't mean it.

983
00:43:26,030 --> 00:43:26,760
You didn't mean it,

984
00:43:26,760 --> 00:43:28,160
but you still pricked me!

985
00:43:28,360 --> 00:43:28,920
What?

986
00:43:29,630 --> 00:43:30,990
If you won't let me,

987
00:43:31,020 --> 00:43:32,640
I'll go tell Grandmother

988
00:43:32,840 --> 00:43:34,400
and let her decide.

989
00:43:34,590 --> 00:43:35,960
Aren't you still hoping

990
00:43:35,980 --> 00:43:37,110
that I'll help you ask Grandmother

991
00:43:37,110 --> 00:43:38,360
for a good marriage?

992
00:43:38,550 --> 00:43:40,010
Don't even think about it.

993
00:43:47,880 --> 00:43:48,480
Wait!

994
00:43:51,440 --> 00:43:52,840
Why should you prick her?

995
00:43:54,010 --> 00:43:55,830
You tripped her on purpose.

996
00:43:56,070 --> 00:43:57,760
She accidentally bumped into you,

997
00:43:57,760 --> 00:43:59,040
so you deserve it.

998
00:44:00,190 --> 00:44:01,230
So what?

999
00:44:01,250 --> 00:44:02,550
I'm the one hurt right now,

1000
00:44:02,550 --> 00:44:04,190
and I'm going to prick her back.

1001
00:44:04,190 --> 00:44:04,760
So...

1002
00:44:05,280 --> 00:44:06,680
Are you going to help her?

1003
00:44:06,840 --> 00:44:07,320
Fine.

1004
00:44:07,840 --> 00:44:09,400
Then I can prick you instead.

1005
00:44:09,400 --> 00:44:10,130
How dare you!

1006
00:44:11,690 --> 00:44:12,920
Grandmother keeps talking about

1007
00:44:12,920 --> 00:44:14,000
manners and rules.

1008
00:44:14,590 --> 00:44:15,590
I thought the rules of this family

1009
00:44:15,590 --> 00:44:16,720
would be so great.

1010
00:44:17,760 --> 00:44:18,480
It seems

1011
00:44:18,760 --> 00:44:20,220
they are nothing special.

1012
00:44:21,880 --> 00:44:23,620
Don't try to provoke me.

1013
00:44:23,650 --> 00:44:25,160
I won't fall for it.

1014
00:44:25,800 --> 00:44:26,400
Is that so?

1015
00:44:28,590 --> 00:44:29,630
I heard you just had your
preliminary betrothal

1016
00:44:29,630 --> 00:44:30,760
with the Yao family.

1017
00:44:31,030 --> 00:44:32,440
The Yao family is a Vice Minister's
household,

1018
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:33,920
a family of poetry and propriety.

1019
00:44:33,920 --> 00:44:35,540
If they knew their future daughter-in-law

1020
00:44:35,540 --> 00:44:36,940
was so unreasonable

1021
00:44:37,110 --> 00:44:38,910
and disregarded sibling bonds,

1022
00:44:39,030 --> 00:44:40,550
I wonder if they would

1023
00:44:40,550 --> 00:44:41,920
regret this marriage.

1024
00:44:43,840 --> 00:44:45,710
You are really out of line, aren't you?

1025
00:44:45,710 --> 00:44:46,510
Stop!

1026
00:44:48,960 --> 00:44:49,630
Lian.

1027
00:44:49,840 --> 00:44:50,440
Grandmother.

1028
00:44:50,440 --> 00:44:51,590
Zhao is right.

1029
00:44:53,560 --> 00:44:54,810
Grandmother.

1030
00:44:54,840 --> 00:44:56,550
Since Zhao is so reasonable,

1031
00:44:57,280 --> 00:44:58,230
come and serve

1032
00:44:58,230 --> 00:44:59,490
your old grandmother.

1033
00:44:59,590 --> 00:45:00,840
Massage my legs.

1034
00:45:11,000 --> 00:45:11,800
Grandmother,

1035
00:45:12,880 --> 00:45:14,080
is the pressure okay?

1036
00:45:19,590 --> 00:45:20,440
Comfortable?

1037
00:45:23,070 --> 00:45:24,890
While you are comfortable,

1038
00:45:25,150 --> 00:45:27,080
let me discuss something with you.

1039
00:45:28,840 --> 00:45:29,590
What is it?

1040
00:45:31,670 --> 00:45:33,040
Twenty years ago,

1041
00:45:33,230 --> 00:45:34,280
my mother lent you

1042
00:45:34,280 --> 00:45:35,610
20,000 taels of silver.

1043
00:45:37,070 --> 00:45:38,730
When do you plan to pay it back?

1044
00:45:41,230 --> 00:45:42,830
What 20,000 taels of silver?

1045
00:45:43,840 --> 00:45:45,900
What nonsense are you talking about?

1046
00:45:59,920 --> 00:46:03,600
[A Splendid Match]

